      "id": 213695,
      "name": "dpt",
      "username": "dpt",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dpt/{size}/1922_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-01-20T06:11:56.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I do that, including the 6-player packs. At that point, there's so much stuff that the insert (any insert) is a little pointless. I have 4 plano boxes: two 5-compartment boxes with invaders, Dahan, and Energy, for use during play; one 4-component compartment with the tokens (Beasts, Disease, etc); and one 6-component compartment for the player disks. Everything else goes in bags.</p><p>One key if you go with plano boxes is to make sure you get ones that will fit a stack of 2 inside the box.</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:44:43.911Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
