      "raw": "<p>I do that, including the 6-player packs. At that point, there&#39;s so much stuff that the insert (any insert) is a little pointless. I have 4 plano boxes: two 5-compartment boxes with invaders, Dahan, and Energy, for use during play; one 4-component compartment with the tokens (Beasts, Disease, etc); and one 6-component compartment for the player disks. Everything else goes in bags.</p><p>One key if you go with plano boxes is to make sure you get ones that will fit a stack of 2 inside the box.</p>",
