      "created_at": "2018-01-24T13:13:52.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/dpt\">@dpt</a>, grysqrl, linkfox<br>\nThanks guys. Definitely helpful! Unfortunately the full range of Plano sizes seem to be less widely available here in Canada, so I’m leaning towards learning how to foamcore and making my own insert. (Though for my first I might go with a less complicated insert to get the hang of things before attempting Spirit Island).</p>",
